        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "（初代北风之狼）\n北风骑士团\n鲁斯坦（本应成为北风之狼）\n法尔伽（据推测，为现任北风之狼）\n西风之鹰",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4901,
        "name": "温妮莎",
        "desc": "<p>曾沦为奴隶，西风骑士团的创建者兼初代团长，有蒲公英骑士的称号。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/04/13/157749474/843dd2247159897d9be7c5a528e90a43_6160478244892773079.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "(据推测，在登上天空岛后化为了西风之鹰。）\n南风之狮",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4901,
        "name": "温妮莎",
